prompt:
A real photograph of a park in Berlin on a sunny Sunday afternoon in late spring, taken as a passer-by would take it with a good phone camera from the path, in a tall vertical picture, everything in sharp focus. Natural colours, bright daylight with a few white clouds in a blue sky. The textures of real grass, bark, leaves, water, stone, wood, wool, wicker, fabric and skin.

The first reference picture shows the young woman in three-quarter view, the second from the front: her face, her dark blonde hair tied back in a ponytail, her build and her height stay exactly as in them. Use them for the person only; her clothes here are a white T-shirt, light-blue jeans and white sneakers, with a light-green cardigan.

Every thing in the park stands on its own, with a little space around it, so that the eye can tell at once where each thing is. Nothing in the picture carries any writing: no signs, no labels, no print.

THE FRONT of the picture, the lower half, is a sunny lawn of green grass with a few daisies:
- on the lawn lies a large red-and-white checked picnic blanket;
- on the blanket stand a wicker picnic basket with its lid open, a glass bottle of water, two red apples with plain unmarked skins and a small round cake on a plate;
- an open book lies face down on the blanket;
- next to the blanket, on the grass, lie the young woman's brown leather backpack and her phone.

THE YOUNG WOMAN of the reference pictures sits on the picnic blanket, seen whole from her head to her sneakers, her legs folded to one side, her knees and sneakers resting on the blanket with their shadow beside them. She is caught in the middle of playing: she has just thrown a yellow ball, her arm still stretched out in front of her, and she watches it with a wide smile. A brown dog runs across the grass towards the ball, its paws on the grass; the ball flies a little above the grass in front of her.

THE MIDDLE of the picture:
- a gravel path crosses the park from left to right behind the lawn;
- on the path, a boy of about ten rides a red bicycle, wearing a blue helmet, both wheels on the gravel;
- beside the path, on the left, a green wooden park bench, with an older man sitting on it reading a newspaper with plain blank pages, and a small bird perched on the back of the bench;
- on the right of the path, a black iron street lamp and a green litter bin.

THE BACK of the picture:
- a calm lake with blue water that reflects the sky;
- a small white rowing boat on the lake with two people in it;
- a low arched stone bridge crossing the lake on the right;
- a stone fountain at the edge of the lake on the left;
- tall green trees all around the lake, a big old chestnut tree on the left with a large stone at its foot, and beds of red and yellow tulips along the path;
- above the trees, the blue sky with a few white clouds.
